Okay, so `HTTPBearer` and `HTTPDigest` both have `__call__` methods that raise `HTTP_403_FORBIDDEN`.

Wait, `HTTPBearer` has its own `__call__` (lines 301-318 in `fastapi/security/http.py`):
```python
